        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA will work with Our company, Faber IA partner, OuraneCloud, a French sovereign cloud provider, to host our solution, ensuring that all data remains confidential and secure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA project management methodology, which combines agile iterations with a phase-gate structure, allows Our company, Faber IA to adapt to the strong seasonality of workload, as per requirement 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The framing phase will pay particular attention to confidentiality, existing production tools, and seasonality, ensuring that our solution is tailored to the client's specific needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve productivity, as per requirement 4, and quality and reliability of work, as per requirement 5, our solution will provide a controlled corpus of information, citing a controlled corpus of information sources, and ensure that all outputs are reliable and accurate." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Our company, Faber IA integration partner, Ligeo Conseil, will connect our solution to the client's business production tools, streamlining workflows and reducing errors." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Quick access to reliable, up-to-date information drawn from accounting standards (PCG), tax doctrine and the tax code (CGI), the commercial code and applicable legal texts, collective-bargaining agreements for payroll/social, and Cabinet Vauclair & Associés internal procedures and methodology guides." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA understand the importance of reliability of figures, as per requirement 7, and our solution is designed to provide accurate and trustworthy information, ensuring that all calculations and outputs are reliable and consistent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA dedicated team, including a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, will work closely with the client to ensure that all requirements are met, and that our solution is delivered on time and within budget." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA governance structure, which includes a joint steering committee, operational committee, and RACI matrix, ensures that all stakeholders are aligned and that there is a clear escalation path in case of any issues." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of availability, Our company, Faber IA have confirmed that Our company, Faber IA can onboard an engagement of this size within the proposed timeline, including the constraint of a pilot before a closing campaign." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA parallel engagements capacity is four, ensuring that Our company, Faber IA can handle multiple projects simultaneously without compromising on quality or delivery timelines." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, Our company, Faber IA proposal addresses every requirement and constraint from the Knowledge Graph, providing a comprehensive solution that meets the client needs and ensures a successful partnership." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires: managing a large volume of regulatory and methodological reference material (req1), maintaining confidentiality (req2), handling strong seasonality of workload (req3), improving productivity (req4) and quality and reliability of work (req5), preserving professional secrecy (req6) and reliability of figures (req7), providing an intelligent assistance tool (req8) and supporting daily activities (req9), with a response time below 2 seconds for common queries (con39), sustaining performance during seasonal peak loads (con40), having availability (con41), integrating with cabinet vauclair associ's production tools (con44), electronic invoicing dematerialisation environment (con45), user directory SSO (con47), and hosting on secnumcloud qualified infrastructure or equivalent (con48)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement, state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED or NOT COVERED by our current stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requirements can be addressed as follows: req1: Managing a large volume of regulatory and methodological reference material is FULLY COVERED by our platform's document-ingestion pipeline and vector store. req2: Maintaining confidentiality is FULLY COVERED through our hosting options, particularly the Sovereign tier on OuraneCloud, which ensures EU-only and renewable-powered infrastructure. req3: Handling strong seasonality of workload is FULLY COVERED as our performance scales horizontally to accommodate peak loads. req4: Improving productivity is PARTIALLY COVERED by our platform's capabilities, such as structured extraction and answer layer with source citations, but may require additional optimization for specific workflows. req5: Quality and reliability of work are PARTIALLY COVERED through our model options, particularly the Sovereign European open-weight model with strong grounding/citation behavior, but also depend on factors like data quality and user training. req6: Preserving professional secrecy is FULLY COVERED by access control measures, including strict partitioning and auditing per client file. req7: Reliability of figures is PARTIALLY COVERED through our structured extraction capabilities, linking figures back to figures source passage, but may require additional validation or verification steps. req8: Providing an intelligent assistance tool is FULLY COVERED by our RAG platform, offering retrieval-augmented generation capabilities. req9: Supporting daily activities is PARTIALLY COVERED as our platform's can be integrated with various tools and systems, but the extent of support depends on specific requirements and integrations. con39: Response time below 2 seconds for common queries is FULLY COVERED, with a median latency of 1.3 seconds and p95 latency below 2.5 seconds. con40: Sustaining performance during seasonal peak loads is FULLY COVERED through our horizontal scaling capabilities. con41: Availability is FULLY COVERED, with high availability during business hours and resilience to peak loads on the appropriate hosting tier. con44: Integration with cabinet vauclair associ's production tools is PARTIALLY COVERED, as our have API-first design and documented APIs for integration, but specific connectors or adapters may need to be developed. con45: Electronic invoicing dematerialisation environment integration is FULLY COVERED through our existing connectors and adapters. con47: User directory SSO is FULLY COVERED, supporting SAML, OIDC, LDAP, and Entra ID. con48: Hosting on SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure or equivalent is FULLY COVERED by our Sovereign tier hosting option on OuraneCloud." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed architecture would involve deploying our RAG platform on the Sovereign tier of OuraneCloud, utilizing the Sovereign European open-weight model for strong grounding and citation behavior. our would integrate with cabinet vauclair associ's production tools using our API-first approach and develop necessary connectors or adapters." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

